{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c301e79294614454e4cbbfa89fe613ce68631e576b25ee55ca7e9150de1a957", "ja": "（街中でピックアップした千早を連れて、\n次の現場に向かっているのだが……）", "zh": "（带着在街上遇到的千早，正前往下一个工作现场，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "fae367df365c98f712d91bcd05f9715b2897d0fa9347678449fa45e9de1e7ba2", "ja": "……。ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6566b3754f2c162cf8009f12e6e54fc16b0b29a97a1a4dd9a5370a5ad396d713", "ja": "千早、何かいいことでもあったのか？", "zh": "千早，遇到什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "590f3fda5fe324831892875b28ef959e41ba8deb5bf234a6472dae6d5072e0ed", "ja": "えっ？　いえ、あの……。\nなぜ、わかるんですか？", "zh": "咦？不，那个……\n你怎么知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3a86d2c2a2cf1d24024d380b2b33a1a93a4cee84fb4d0b77475b746b23fdec9c", "ja": "わかるよ、ずっと嬉しそうにしてるから。\nそれで？", "zh": "我当然看得出来，因为你一直都一副很开心的样子。\n然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e18869d09b411e1f67ed11e38623fe963679eb444f7c3a2262d3dba904236fe", "ja": "……じつは、迎えに来ていただく前に、\nファンの方達とすれ違ったんです。", "zh": "……其实，在您来接我之前，\n我和几位粉丝擦肩而过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "76dc45d983386c820b6714c1a47a8ead2d46070cdc5c3252f40d8d553d2bcaf9", "ja": "みなさん、この間のライブグッズを身につけていて。\nTシャツや帽子、それに大きなタオルも。", "zh": "大家身上都带着上次演唱会的周边。\n不仅有T恤和帽子，还有大毛巾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e2bd04edf2dae5afce09933b51dcdbcacca3f45e060338340e07aa70aff00e2e", "ja": "へえ？　千早本人だってことは、\n気づかれなかったのか？", "zh": "咦？没人发现那是千早本人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "c25b98c3cc1689c4ed4cb777fc7cb811b09d1094057d8efb1b1922cfa8df506e", "ja": "はい、道路の反対側でしたので。\nそれにみなさん、お話に夢中で……。", "zh": "是的，因为当时在马路对面。\n而且大家都聊得入迷了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9fca68fc8ce5463d76903970f1f973f2f86da0fbaca02f2c2d50b47625885781", "ja": "なるほど。でも、それは確かに嬉しいな。\nライブの後も、そんな風に楽しんでもらえてるなんて。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，确实让人高兴。\n没想到演出结束后，大家还能那样开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "e88362a3ee875c7807342d46e0115ca943a985d667a4b5ae0fde8d8764c8b1ae", "ja": "そうなんです！　その……。", "zh": "就是这样！那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "3bab9352381789d543e9558ead4674738ffbb6419499832805f548f4bd58968f", "ja": "ライブのここがよかったとか、ここで感動したとか。\n感想のお手紙を頂けるのも嬉しいのですが……。", "zh": "能收到大家写来的感想信，告诉我演唱会哪里好、哪里让他们感动，我也很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "b0a5d972dc1f4561591b8889039ffdeb43de605e2a6fbd135fdc674f29a71c87", "ja": "ああして、知らないところでも楽しんでもらえている\nことを目の当たりにして、とても……嬉しかったです。", "zh": "亲眼看到即使在我不知道的地方，也有人那样享受着，真的……很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "8cb29957195c0f54ed0dd81b88060b2af694d4ef0d9a5a986749bcc13d055339", "ja": "でも、ダメですね。今はもう次の仕事があるのに。\n……気を引き締めないと。", "zh": "可是，这样不行呢。明明现在已经有下一份工作了。\n……得打起精神来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1014_p", "source_sha256": "476f582b9f38f96d0b31da2900ddb692e397c463e2736b105e09590c75bb28dd", "ja": "そこは素直に喜んでいいんじゃないかな。\nみんなのステージが、ちゃんと届いた証拠だから。", "zh": "还是坦率地为此高兴一下比较好吧。  \n因为这正证明了大家的舞台确实传达到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3b62f0107f44799a6f61f35b1871b127cb12c42930ae4db0995cab45c736323a", "ja": "むしろ励みにして、そして、次に向かっていこう。", "zh": "反而应该把它当作动力，然后向着下一次迈进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "178d229bfcf0894974f5ad8707dd7f61e4ce733fd1d5cba0218bc0a5171f261b", "ja": "次に向かって……そうですね。\nライブが終わった後は、次のライブに向かって。", "zh": "朝着下一个目标……是啊。\n演出结束后，就朝着下一场演出前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "b227ed93b3a36a120eddfc4c6cde6da0dd16bf5d0f654a58ec34643cabad06f6", "ja": "では、次の仕事も……、その次も。\nよろしくお願いします、{$P$}。", "zh": "那么，接下来的工作也是……还有再下一份工作。\n今后也请多多关照，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0563_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5fd3199ba4536bf46be9e5b739dbd1455d8dd37f22e553105faf8a88f32e2044", "ja": "ああ、こちらこそ。\nこれからもよろしく、千早！", "zh": "啊，我才要请你多多关照。\n今后也请多指教，千早！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
